  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Nitin Jain Alias Nitin Kumar Jain vs Ut Of J&K And Ors on 23 August, 2023 Author: Moksha Khajuria Kazmi Bench: Moksha Khajuria Kazmi Sr.No. 215 High Court Of Jammu & Kashmir And Ladakh At Jammu Crm(M) No.706/2023 Nitin Jain alias Nitin Kumar Jain ....Petitioner(s)/Appella Through :- Mr. Rohit Kohli, Advocate. V/s Ut of J&K and ors. ....Respondent Through :- Coram: Hon'Ble Ms. Justice Moksha Khajuria Kazmi, Judge Order 01.",
    "facts": "03. It is submitted that account in the name of proprietorship concern i.e. M/s Sunit Kumar Nitin Kumar Jain is being maintained with central Bank of India, Branch New Sabzi Mandi, Narwal, Jammu and Sh. Sunit Kumar Jain was the proprietor of Ms/ Sunit Kumar Nitin Kumar Jain.",
    "arguments": "02. Learned counsel for the petitioners states that in the complaint, petitioner has been shown as Proprietor of M/s Sunit Kumar Nitin Kumar Jain, as such, has been arrayed as accused No.2 which is not factually correct.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "02. Learned counsel for the petitioners states that in the complaint, petitioner has been shown as Proprietor of M/s Sunit Kumar Nitin Kumar Jain, as such, has been arrayed as accused No.2 which is not factually correct.",
